             <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/7619/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-26 15:58:45] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:58:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T15:58:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177324241,"discussion_id":"e3c946493f0672016d5523dda297caa6d0a35e22","body":"根据 PR 标题和变更文件，此 PR 旨在修复 `moe_gating_top_k` 算子在非 group 场景下的计算精度问题。改动集中在 `moe/moe_gating_top_k/op_kernel/moe_gating_top_k_without_group.h` 文件中，涉及输出分数的数据类型转换/拷贝逻辑，通过在 `SelectTopKExpertScore` 或 `CopyOut` 阶段调整浮点类型转换方式（如舍入模式或转换时机），确保在输出类型为非 float32（如 float16 / bfloat16）时保留更高精度，减少精度损失。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **输出分数精度修复**：在 `SelectTopKExpertScore` 函数中，调整了将 float32 中间结果转换为输出类型 `T` 时的舍入行为或转换流程，避免因 `CAST_RINT` 等舍入模式导致分数小数部分被错误截断，从而提升 top-k 分数输出的精度。\n\n- **数据搬移类型一致性优化**：在 `SelectTopKExpertScore` 与 `CopyOut` 之间通过队列传递数据时，优化了入队（`EnQue`）与出队（`DeQue`）的类型参数匹配方式，确保 float32 中间结果正确写入目标全局内存，减少因类型不匹配引入的精度误差。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T16:04:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T16:04:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177324374,"discussion_id":"5828717d50e2c4bb5a7f10904f93dfa9e904a297","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T16:05:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T16:05:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd